      "name": "Does NJMC manufacture active pharmaceutical ingredients?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. NJMC is a sourcing and consultancy company. We do not own production facilities and we do not represent a single factory, which is what allows a shortlist to reflect your specification rather than our inventory."
